                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It was my privilege to preside over The House during the passage to end the COVID vaccine mandate on our healthcare workers. These heroes must be enabled to do their jobs, not hindered. Today, we showed the House supports our healthcare professionals. \n\nhttps://t.co/ma6bH4efcs",
