                "text": "The support our nation gives our veterans is unmatched. Yesterday school districts around DFW delivered valentines to patients at the Dallas VA. These small acts of kindness are what make us Americans. \n\nAs a veteran, thank you, as an American, God Bless you. https://t.co/N9NYwtQjJD",
