                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Yesterday, we passed H.R. 8371, the Senator Elizabeth Dole 21st Century Veterans Healthcare and Benefits Improvement Act. As a Navy veteran, I couldn't be more proud of this body. Thank you Chairman @RepBost and the @HouseVetAffairs, for all of your dedication on this bill. https://t.co/qYgeSX8S0G",
